# API and DTO Rules

- Controllers must stay thin and delegate business logic to services.
- Validate non-trivial request inputs using DTOs.
- Prefer zod-backed DTOs with `createZodDto`.
- Keep route naming and response shape consistent with neighboring modules.
- Use response wrapper service for consistent success/paginated payloads when added.
